shiji-003-yin:m022-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"祖己","kind":"person","person_id":"80h_7uw_251","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p022","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m023-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"祖己","kind":"person","person_id":"80h_7uw_251","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p023","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006","text":"遷尚書左僕射，侍中如故。頠雖後之親屬，然雅望素隆，四海不謂之以親戚進也，惟恐其不居位。俄復使頠專任門下事，固讓，不聽。頠上言：「賈模適亡，復以臣代，崇外戚之望，彰偏私之舉。後族何常有能自保，皆知重親無脫者也。然漢二十四帝惟孝文、光武、明帝不重外戚，皆保其宗，豈將獨賢，實以安理故也。昔穆叔不拜越禮之饗，臣亦不敢聞殊常之詔。」又表云：「咎繇謨虞，伊尹相商，呂望翊周，蕭張佐漢，咸播功化，光格四極。暨于繼體，咎單、傅說，祖己、樊仲，亦隆中興。或明揚側陋，或起自庶族，豈非尚德之舉，以臻斯美哉！曆觀近世，不能慕遠，溺於近情，多任後親，以致不靜。昔疏廣戒太子以舅氏為官屬，前世以為知禮。況朝廷何取于外戚，正復才均，尚當先其疏者，以明至公。漢世不用馮野王，即其事也。」表上，皆優詔敦譬。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"root已採納裴頠同指，以4ni_4t1_4o9_AAB為keeper；本研究初次capture早於該接合，dc7僅歷史輸入，不是當前候選或alias。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"後","kind":"person","person_id":"c27_590_7e3_A","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"040p017–018郭槐女/太子妃/賈后，與本段太子廢黜/趙王倫事相同。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"root已採納裴頠同指，以4ni_4t1_4o9_AAB為keeper；本研究初次capture早於該接合，dc7僅歷史輸入，不是當前候選或alias。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"root已採納裴頠同指，以4ni_4t1_4o9_AAB為keeper；本研究初次capture早於該接合，dc7僅歷史輸入，不是當前候選或alias。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"賈模","kind":"person","person_id":"uj1_vqj_191","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"已親讀040p028–029張華裴顗同心輔政及卒，與此完整議后/適亡相接；不把裴顗異字改原文。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"root已採納裴頠同指，以4ni_4t1_4o9_AAB為keeper；本研究初次capture早於該接合，dc7僅歷史輸入，不是當前候選或alias。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:u0086","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"start":86,"end":88,"surface":"後族","status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"泛後族類別，不全作當朝賈后"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:u0105","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"start":105,"end":110,"surface":"漢二十四帝","status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"漢帝集合；不造24profiles，不機械列全"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"孝文","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"漢二十四帝限定語內孝文，不指北魏孝文。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"光武","kind":"person","person_id":"6c9_c43_555","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"漢二十四帝限定語；現同人已名文叔，非晉帝。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"明帝","kind":"person","person_id":"rdh_7yg_9xk","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"與孝文光武同在漢帝集合，不指魏/晉明帝。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"穆叔","kind":"person","person_id":"18r_wn6_nhh","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本句不拜越禮之饗；已讀033p072穆叔但非同事件，原典尚待核，不未讀補叔孫豹新ID。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0151","start":151,"end":152,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"root已採納裴頠同指，以4ni_4t1_4o9_AAB為keeper；本研究初次capture早於該接合，dc7僅歷史輸入，不是當前候選或alias。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0167","start":167,"end":169,"surface":"咎繇","kind":"person","person_id":"p3l_pp3_n6i","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"謨虞之臣的古史語境，保原咎繇，不與泛虞朝名混作兩人；原生前須核主登記支援段。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"相商之古臣；不另造同名，其他分身不在此合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"呂望","kind":"person","person_id":"1g3_02y_oor","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"翊周之古臣，首選現太公望；保原呂望。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0182","start":182,"end":183,"surface":"蕭","kind":"person","person_id":"xd8_uww_5ok","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"蕭張佐漢連稱之蕭，分人，不把整詞給單人。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0183","start":183,"end":184,"surface":"張","kind":"person","person_id":"ea5_zvr_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"蕭張佐漢連稱之張，分人。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"咎單","kind":"person","person_id":"0h0_68r_si5","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"與傅說祖己樊仲並列中興臣，不與咎繇混。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0205","start":205,"end":207,"surface":"傅說","kind":"person","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"古臣引稱，不當傅姓當世官。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0208","start":208,"end":210,"surface":"祖己","kind":"person","person_id":"80h_7uw_251","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"古臣引稱，不接祖沖之/祖逖同姓家族。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0211","start":211,"end":213,"surface":"樊仲","kind":"person","person_id":"drr_d46_t8n","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"周中興臣，兩現有樊仲山父/仲山甫候選待原段核；不新造第三人或硬合兩ID。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0270","start":270,"end":272,"surface":"疏廣","kind":"person","person_id":"e6v_j6q_wrh","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"引古諫太子舅氏官屬，現有羊祜書引古；原生前宜核疏廣故事平行，非今太子臣。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0273","start":273,"end":275,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"72m_dhb_tf7","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"疏廣不獨親外家為太子官屬的故事，與漢書071宣帝/許氏及009宣帝太子即孝元相接；首選後來漢元帝，非最近晉太子；晉概括與漢對上奏語非逐字同引。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:u0276","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"start":276,"end":278,"surface":"舅氏","status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"疏廣典故親屬類稱，未讀原典不補許氏名"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p006:m0319","start":319,"end":322,"surface":"馮野王","kind":"person","person_id":"1mu_6ja_3mp","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"漢世不用馮野王，registry未見全名；不造其父母妻或合馮奉世。"}],"source_position":{"raw_start":4207,"raw_end":4545,"raw_character_offsets":[4207,4208,4209,4210,4211,4212,4213,4214,4215,4216,4217,4218,4219,4220,4221,4222,4223,4224,4225,4226,4227,4228,4229,4230,4231,4232,4233,4234,4235,4236,4237,4238,4239,4240,4241,4242,4243,4244,4245,4246,4247,4248,4249,4250,4251,4252,4253,4254,4255,4256,4257,4258,4259,4260,4261,4262,4263,4264,4265,4266,4267,4268,4269,4270,4271,4272,4273,4274,4275,4276,4277,4278,4279,4280,4281,4282,4283,4284,4285,4286,4287,4288,4289,4290,4291,4292,4293,4294,4295,4296,4297,4298,4299,4300,4301,4302,4303,4304,4305,4306,4307,4308,4309,4310,4311,4312,4313,4314,4315,4316,4317,4318,4319,4320,4321,4322,4323,4324,4325,4326,4327,4328,4329,4330,4331,4332,4333,4334,4335,4336,4337,4338,4339,4340,4341,4342,4343,4344,4345,4346,4347,4348,4349,4350,4351,4352,4353,4354,4355,4356,4357,4358,4359,4360,4361,4362,4363,4364,4365,4366,4367,4368,4369,4370,4371,4372,4373,4374,4375,4376,4377,4378,4379,4380,4381,4382,4383,4384,4385,4386,4387,4388,4389,4390,4391,4392,4393,4394,4395,4396,4397,4398,4399,4400,4401,4402,4403,4404,4405,4406,4407,4408,4409,4410,4411,4412,4413,4414,4415,4416,4417,4418,4419,4420,4421,4422,4423,4424,4425,4426,4427,4428,4429,4430,4431,4432,4433,4434,4435,4436,4437,4438,4439,4440,4441,4442,4443,4444,4445,4446,4447,4448,4449,4450,4451,4452,4453,4454,4455,4456,4457,4458,4459,4460,4461,4462,4463,4464,4465,4466,4467,4468,4469,4470,4471,4472,4473,4474,4475,4476,4477,4478,4479,4480,4481,4482,4483,4484,4485,4486,4487,4488,4