rovisional","interpretation_note":"只依本段對話的君主與事件暫定，不作全篇通用的帝／王匹配。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m022-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"武丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"source_identified"}],"annotation_status":"in_progress","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p023","text":"帝武丁崩，子帝祖庚立。祖己嘉武丁之以祥雉為德，立其廟為高宗，遂作高宗肜日及訓。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m023-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"帝武丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m023-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"帝祖庚","kind":"person","person_id":"f41_iwq_mkl","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m023-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"祖己","kind":"person","person_id":"80h_7uw_251","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m023-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"武丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m023-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"高宗","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依祖己為武丁立廟的敘事暫定此稱指武丁；書篇名稱高宗肜日另不作人物。"}],"annotation_status":"in_progress","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-ws2506399-peiwei","source":{"title":"《晉書》卷三十五子頠完整附傳選錄","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷035&oldid=2506399","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷035&oldid=2506399","revision_id":2506399,"accessed_on":"2026-10-24","extent":"子頠附傳完整十五自然段，含晉書收到崇有之論全部引文容器及二子敘述；非裴秀全傳/卷035全卷或獨立原著全文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄，保留來源歸屬；數位文字依CC BY-SA 4.0。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/license